<main class="lui-page" aria-labelledby="lockui-title"><div class="lui-wrap">
  <header class="lui-stack"><div class="lui-cluster" style="justify-content: space-between"><a class="wordmark" href="/" aria-label="LockIn home"><img src="/media/logo-text.png" alt="LockIn"></a><a class="lui-link" href="/">Back to LockIn</a></div><div class="lui-stack" style="gap: 8px"><span class="lui-eyebrow">Developer reference</span><h1 id="lockui-title">LockUI</h1><p class="lui-muted" style="max-width: 650px; line-height: 1.6">The shared visual language for LockIn. Use these primitives before adding page-specific CSS so every screen feels like it belongs to the same desk.</p></div></header>
  <section class="lui-section" aria-labelledby="foundations-title"><div class="lui-section-title"><h2 id="foundations-title">Foundations</h2><p>Tokens, panels, spacing, badges, and status states.</p></div><div class="lui-grid"><article class="lui-card"><h3>Work in progress</h3><p>Keep the next action visible and the surrounding noise quiet.</p><div class="lui-cluster" style="margin-top: 16px"><span class="lui-status lui-status-success">Ready</span><span class="lui-status lui-status-warning">Needs review</span><span class="lui-status lui-status-danger">Blocked</span></div></article><article class="lui-card"><div class="lui-cluster"><span class="lui-avatar">AM</span><div><strong>Alex Morgan</strong><div class="lui-muted" style="font-size: 11px">Course editor</div></div></div><hr class="lui-divider"><div class="lui-progress" aria-label="Course progress"><span style="width: 68%"></span></div></article></div></section>
  <section class="lui-section" aria-labelledby="actions-title"><div class="lui-section-title"><h2 id="actions-title">Actions and forms</h2><p>Buttons, icon actions, fields, validation, and keyboard affordances.</p></div><div class="lui-panel lui-stack"><div class="lui-cluster"><button class="lui-button lui-button-primary" type="button"><i data-lucide="plus"></i> Create item</button><button class="lui-button lui-button-secondary" type="button"><i data-lucide="save"></i> Save draft</button><button class="lui-button lui-button-quiet" type="button">Cancel</button><button class="lui-button lui-button-danger" type="button"><i data-lucide="trash-2"></i> Delete</button><button class="lui-icon-button" type="button" aria-label="More actions"><i data-lucide="ellipsis"></i></button><span class="lui-muted">Shortcut <kbd class="lui-kbd">Cmd K</kbd></span></div><div class="lui-grid"><label class="lui-field">Title<input class="lui-input" value="Read chapter 4" aria-describedby="title-help"><span class="lui-help" id="title-help">A short, useful name is easiest to scan.</span></label><label class="lui-field">Course<select class="lui-select"><option>Biology 101</option><option>Modern History</option></select></label><label class="lui-field lui-grid-wide">Notes<textarea class="lui-textarea" placeholder="Add context for your future self..."></textarea></label></div><label class="lui-check"><input type="checkbox" checked> Keep this private to my Todo</label></div></section>
  <section class="lui-section" aria-labelledby="feedback-title"><div class="lui-section-title"><h2 id="feedback-title">Feedback and navigation</h2><p>Use clear feedback and compact navigation for repeated workflows.</p></div><div class="lui-grid"><div class="lui-stack"><div class="lui-alert"><i data-lucide="info"></i><span>Details are checked by peers before they become part of the shared course space.</span></div><div class="lui-alert lui-alert-success"><i data-lucide="circle-check"></i><span>Your changes were saved.</span></div><div class="lui-alert lui-alert-warning"><i data-lucide="triangle-alert"></i><span>This item still needs a date.</span></div><div class="lui-alert lui-alert-danger" role="alert"><i data-lucide="circle-alert"></i><span>We could not complete that action.</span></div></div><div class="lui-panel lui-stack"><nav class="lui-tabs" aria-label="Reference views"><button class="lui-tab" aria-selected="true" type="button">Overview</button><button class="lui-tab" aria-selected="false" type="button">Activity</button><button class="lui-tab" aria-selected="false" type="button">People</button></nav><ul class="lui-list"><li><span>Upcoming deadlines</span><span class="lui-badge">4 items</span></li><li><span>Shared resources</span><span class="lui-badge">12 links</span></li><li><span>Open questions</span><span class="lui-badge">3 new</span></li></ul></div></div></section>
  <section class="lui-section" aria-labelledby="data-title"><div class="lui-section-title"><h2 id="data-title">Data and empty states</h2><p>Tables stay readable, while empty screens still give people a next step.</p></div><div class="lui-table-wrap"><table class="lui-table"><thead><tr><th>Item</th><th>Owner</th><th>Status</th><th>Updated</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Research outline</td><td>Alex Morgan</td><td><span class="lui-status lui-status-success">Complete</span></td><td class="lui-muted">Today</td></tr><tr><td>Group presentation</td><td>Jamie Lee</td><td><span class="lui-status lui-status-warning">In review</span></td><td class="lui-muted">Yesterday</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class="lui-empty"><i data-lucide="inbox"></i><strong>Nothing here yet</strong><span>New shared work will appear in this space.</span><button class="lui-button lui-button-primary" type="button">Add the first item</button></div></section>
  <section class="lui-section" aria-labelledby="code-title"><div class="lui-section-title"><h2 id="code-title">Copyable element code</h2><p>Each sample is the exact markup for a LockUI primitive. Copy it directly into a view.</p></div><div class="lui-grid"><div class="lui-code-sample"><pre id="lockui-code-button"><code>&lt;button class="lui-button lui-button-primary" type="button"&gt;
  Create item
&lt;/button&gt;</code></pre><button class="lui-copy-button" type="button" data-copy-code-button data-copy-code-target="lockui-code-button" aria-label="Copy button element code"><i data-lucide="copy"></i><span data-copy-label>Copy code</span></button></div><div class="lui-code-sample"><pre id="lockui-code-alert"><code>&lt;div class="lui-alert lui-alert-success" role="status"&gt;
  Your changes were saved.
&lt;/div&gt;</code></pre><button class="lui-copy-button" type="button" data-copy-code-button data-copy-code-target="lockui-code-alert" aria-label="Copy alert element code"><i data-lucide="copy"></i><span data-copy-label>Copy code</span></button></div><div class="lui-code-sample"><pre id="lockui-code-field"><code>&lt;label class="lui-field"&gt;
  Title
  &lt;input class="lui-input" type="text"&gt;
&lt;/label&gt;</code></pre><button class="lui-copy-button" type="button" data-copy-code-button data-copy-code-target="lockui-code-field" aria-label="Copy field element code"><i data-lucide="copy"></i><span data-copy-label>Copy code</span></button></div><div class="lui-code-sample"><pre id="lockui-code-status"><code>&lt;span class="lui-status lui-status-success"&gt;Ready&lt;/span&gt;</code></pre><button class="lui-copy-button" type="button" data-copy-code-button data-copy-code-target="lockui-code-status" aria-label="Copy status element code"><i data-lucide="copy"></i><span data-copy-label>Copy code</span></button></div></div></section>
</div></main>